sequenceDiagram
    actor Op as Operator
    participant SA as SecurityAnalyst
    participant AG as LangChain agent (Gemini)
    participant TK as Toolkit (5 tools)
    participant DB as SQLite index
    participant GC as Citation check

    Op->>SA: "How many times did the blue Ford F150 enter today?"
    SA->>AG: question + history<br/>(system prompt holds the day/hour summaries)
    AG->>TK: entity_history("blue Ford F150")
    TK->>DB: match entities, load visits + alerts
    DB-->>TK: V-002: 2 visits, frames 256..270 and 454..466
    TK-->>AG: JSON with frame ids
    AG-->>SA: "Twice: 09:14 [f256] and 16:45 [f454]."
    SA->>GC: cited {256, 454} subset of retrieved ids?
    GC-->>SA: grounded (no unsupported citations)
    SA-->>Op: answer + tool calls
    Op->>SA: "When did it leave?"
    Note over SA,AG: history kept, "it" = the F150
    SA->>AG: follow-up
    AG->>TK: entity_history("blue Ford F150")
    AG-->>Op: "09:42 [f270] and 17:10 [f466]."
    alt Gemini unavailable (no key, quota, network)
        SA->>TK: offline router: same tools, same citations
        TK-->>Op: deterministic answer, or "Not enough evidence"
    end
